sequenceDiagram
  participant Host as Native or program caller
  participant Run as Invocation owner
  participant Src as Evidence owner
  participant Rules as Rule admission
  participant Sel as Selection owner
  participant Judge as Judgment owner
  participant HTTP as Jev adapter
  Note over Host,Run: Proposed-only. Caller selects RuleSets and starts this invocation
  Host->>Run: skill bindings, RuleSet paths, repo scopes, settings and cancellation
  Run->>Src: capture selected RuleSet JSON bytes
  Src-->>Run: captured definitions or source failure
  Run->>Rules: validate RuleSets and resolve explicit JSONL references
  Rules-->>Run: referenced paths or safe definition diagnostics
  Run->>Src: capture referenced JSONL and scoped subject/context bytes
  Src-->>Run: frozen snapshot or source failure
  Run->>Rules: preflight all captured rule definitions and named questions
  Rules-->>Run: admitted RuleSets/rules or source-linked diagnostics
  alt capture failed or definitions invalid
    Run-->>Host: preparation failure or invalid invocation, no inference
  else admitted
    Run->>Sel: before/current targets, context, applicability and effective questions
    Sel->>Src: query frozen sources under caller scope
    Src-->>Sel: evidence or source diagnostics
    Sel-->>Run: every occurrence selected, skipped or failed
    Note over Run,Src: Required evidence must be complete, optional omissions remain attributed
    Run->>Judge: named questions with RuleSet prefix and captured state
    Judge->>Judge: validate and assess complete encoded request
    alt supported and within budget, not aborted
      Judge->>HTTP: admitted body, finite attempts and cancellation
      Note over HTTP: External inference may occur, cancellation cannot reverse it
      HTTP-->>Judge: untrusted body or safe failure and attempt observations
      alt response admitted and not aborted
        Judge-->>Run: native answers, receipt and attempts
        Run->>Run: retain one outcome and correlate authored question references
      else failure or observed abort
        Judge-->>Run: typed execution outcome, no completed answer references
      end
    else invalid, required overflow or refused accounting
      Judge-->>Run: diagnostic, no inference
    end
    Note over Run: Cancellation stops scheduling and joins owned work before terminal return
    Run-->>Host: source-linked native judgments, coverage, diagnostics and measurements
  end
